            <div xml:id="d381">

                <pb facs="0427" n="361" sameAs="frus:frus1934v05/pg361"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.516/287: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Haiti</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Armour</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-05-22T18:00:00-04:00">May 22, 1934—6 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>33. Your 52, May 22, 1 p.m. We agree to omit from the second “whereas” clause of
                    preamble the phrase mentioned in your paragraph 1.</p>
                <p>We will make every effort to see that full powers and instructions are sent by
                    Thursday’s plane from Miami.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
